<title>TANZANIA: Police seize 143 elephant tusks in Zanzibar.</title>
<headline>Police seize 143 elephant tusks in Zanzibar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Police seized 143 elephant tusks on the Indian Ocean island of Zanzibar bound for Thailand, state Zanzibar radio said on Monday.</p>
<p>The radio, monitored by the British Broadcasting Corportation, said the ivory -- in two crates meant to contain machine spare parts -- was seized following a tip-off.</p>
<p>Two officials from the Zanzibari company allegedly sending the crates were detained for transporting ivory, it added.</p>
</text>
